{
  "id": "filter.colorAdjust",
  "version": 1,
  "domain": "filter",
  "inputs": 1,
  "params": {
    "grayscale": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "min": 0,
      "max": 1
    },
    "brightness": {
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "min": -1,
      "max": 1
    }
  },
  "color": {
    "colorSpace": "srgb-premultiplied",
    "precision": "u8"
  },
  "kernel": "color-adjust-grayscale-brightness-f64",
  "origin": "top-left",
  "alpha": "premultiplied",
  "sampling": "nearest",
  "edge": "clamp",
  "resizeMode": "same-as-input",
  "determinism": "strict",
  "capabilities": [],
  "fallback": null,
  "doc": "Timeline 0.1 的 fx {grayscale, brightness} 复合配方——**逐行等价于 studio_export 的 apply_media_effects**：同一趟循环里先向 Rec.709 亮度插值再加亮度偏移，最后一次 clamp+预乘。拆成两条 filter 串联会多一次 u8 round-trip，像素不同，所以它自成一个配方。"
}
